From feeec356532482b6c382ea8295b38dfd9924e869 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Data-crea <sattler.daniel@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:28:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] OrionLayer Open Fix 58: one command per battle action,
 consumed where the human's input is read (MSG_COMBAT_COMMAND)

Ported onto orion2re v2.0.0 in scratch (work order 242 e) from local e4b2256a:
combat1.cpp: the command hook by hand after v2's Get_Tactical_Input() (v2 wraps fields::Get_Input in a config-reload filter); the two Combat_Command_Cell hunks placed whitespace-insensitively (v2 uses MOX::combat_grid_width/height).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
